{"1080630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hero Express", "steam_appid": 1080630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Hero Express is an atypical driving game. You won't be competing with other drivers to see who reaches the goal first, you will try hard to reach the goal ALIVE. <br>Each track is filled with obstacles and hazards, and the player is the one that'll have to exploit his skill in this 2d physics-driven driving game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/dc254625be54baa91a0d1905669ea87b.poster.avif?t=1737107444\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/dc254625be54baa91a0d1905669ea87b.webm?t=1737107444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/dc254625be54baa91a0d1905669ea87b.mp4?t=1737107444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 11 Crazy Tracks<br></li><li> 11 Unique Vehicles<br></li><li> 4 Upgradable Stats<br></li><li> 16 Different Hazards<br></li><li> 2 Powerups<br></li><li> 2 Difficulties</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/aa1b94fcdb16a323ec98e5ecb8236241.avif?t=1737107444\" width=630 height=150 /></span><br><br><br><i>Hero is really absent-minded and always forgets his heroic tools. <br>Who will save the day when the hero needs saving? The Hero Express of course. <br>And you are the best of the best, Delivery guy, the one sent on impossible missions. <br>Help Hero save the world with your mad driving skills!</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/487c3cbf6f66df3d62ecd03b4a69e2c1.avif?t=1737107444\" width=630 height=236 /></span>", "about_the_game": "Hero Express is an atypical driving game. You won't be competing with other drivers to see who reaches the goal first, you will try hard to reach the goal ALIVE. <br>Each track is filled with obstacles and hazards, and the player is the one that'll have to exploit his skill in this 2d physics-driven driving game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/dc254625be54baa91a0d1905669ea87b.poster.avif?t=1737107444\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/dc254625be54baa91a0d1905669ea87b.webm?t=1737107444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/dc254625be54baa91a0d1905669ea87b.mp4?t=1737107444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 11 Crazy Tracks<br></li><li> 11 Unique Vehicles<br></li><li> 4 Upgradable Stats<br></li><li> 16 Different Hazards<br></li><li> 2 Powerups<br></li><li> 2 Difficulties</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/aa1b94fcdb16a323ec98e5ecb8236241.avif?t=1737107444\" width=630 height=150 /></span><br><br><br><i>Hero is really absent-minded and always forgets his heroic tools. <br>Who will save the day when the hero needs saving? The Hero Express of course. <br>And you are the best of the best, Delivery guy, the one sent on impossible missions. <br>Help Hero save the world with your mad driving skills!</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/extras/487c3cbf6f66df3d62ecd03b4a69e2c1.avif?t=1737107444\" width=630 height=236 /></span>", "short_description": "Hero Express is an amazing 2d physics-driven driving game, full of strategy and fun. Go to an awesome journey around the world and save the planet!", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Oh, and did I tell you that Hero Express is super cheap to purchase too?”<br>8 – TheXboxHub<br><br>“Hero Express is a perfect combination of Excitebike-like balance physics and addictive Roguelite mechanics.”<br>8.5 – GamePitt<br><br>“Hero Express is a great example of an indie game doing everything right. A simple concept, presented in bite-size chunks which will challenge your gaming skills. All while blasting out an epic soundtrack.”<br>8 – GamingBoulevard<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/header.jpg?t=1737107444", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737107444", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737107444", "website": "https://www.fantasticostudio.it/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Lion 10.7.5, 32/64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0+ (2.1 with ARB extensions acceptable)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Highwalls"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD